msgid "Your colleague has accidentally chosen an eigenvector for his/her initial vector. Acting with the matrix on the initial vector will simply return the same vector back, scaled by the eigenvalue. This will not generate a subspace of increasing dimension. Advise your colleague to select a different initial vector, making sure it is not an eigenvector.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply the Krylov method to the given matrix, selecting an appropriate new initial vector. Write down the estimates of the minimum eigenvalue at the 0th and 1st order of your Krylov subspace.\n"
msgstr "Seu colega acidentalmente escolheu um autovetor como vetor inicial. Aplicar a matriz ao vetor inicial simplesmente retornará o mesmo vetor, escalado pelo autovalor. Isso não gerará um subespaço de dimensão crescente. Aconselhe seu colega a escolher um vetor inicial diferente, certificando-se de que não seja um autovetor.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Aplique o método de Krylov à matriz abaixo, selecionando um novo vetor inicial apropriado. Escreva as estimativas do autovalor mínimo na 0ª e na 1ª ordem do seu subespaço de Krylov.\n"
"$$\n"
"A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are many possible answers depending on the choice of initial vector. We will choose:\n"
"$$\n"
"|v_0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
"To get $|v_1\\rangle$ we apply $A$ once to $|v_0\\rangle$, and then make $|v_1\\rangle$ orthogonal to $|v_0\\rangle.$\n"
"$$\n"
"A|v_0\\rangle=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"A|v_0\\rangle - \\langle v_0|A|v_0\\rangle |v_0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}-\\frac{7}{3}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}-1/3\\\\2/3\\\\-1/3\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
"At 0th order, the projection onto our Krylov subspace is\n"
msgstr ""
"Há muitas respostas possíveis dependendo da escolha do vetor inicial. Escolheremos:\n"
"$$\n"
"|v_0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
"Para obter $|v_1\\rangle$, aplicamos $A$ uma vez a $|v_0\\rangle$, e então tornamos $|v_1\\rangle$ ortogonal a $|v_0\\rangle.$\n"
"$$\n"
"A|v_0\\rangle=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"A|v_0\\rangle - \\langle v_0|A|v_0\\rangle |v_0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}-\\frac{7}{3}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}-1/3\\\\2/3\\\\-1/3\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
"Na 0ª ordem, a projeção sobre o nosso subespaço de Krylov é\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle v_0|A|v_0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{7}{3}\n"
"$$\n"
"At 1st order, the projection onto this Krylov subspace is\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle v_0|A|v_0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{7}{3}\n"
"$$\n"
"Na 1ª ordem, a projeção sobre esse subespaço de Krylov é\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle V^1|A|V^1\\rangle=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\\\-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}&\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}&-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}\\\\\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}& \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} \\\\  \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
"This can be done by hand, but is most easily done using numpy:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle V^1|A|V^1\\rangle=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\\\-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}&\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}&-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}\\\\\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}& \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} \\\\  \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
"Isso pode ser feito à mão, mas é mais fácil usando numpy:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "outputs:\n"
msgstr "saída:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
