"    \\\\\n"
"    &\\qquad-\\left(e^{-i\\phi}\\bra{\\psi_0}-\\bra{\\psi_0}U^\\dagger\\right)P\\left(e^{i\\phi}\\ket{\\psi_0}-U\\ket{\\psi_0}\\right)\n"
"    \\Big)\\\\\n"
